msgid "⟪k:0⟫And so I did as she said."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫E così feci come diceva."

#: scenario7:scenario7_4A0A5FD6_4842_4075_A936_8A77F1032138
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8710c5eb57549d7ac77ae326d09cb435738d40b79008859954aa845b8380ba05
