msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Firmavo ogni lettera come “Michelle”—"

#: scenario7:scenario7_115FC035_3AAB_4941_9F70_A7FDD8BA7472
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 78a7a2ae0783fa0acd48c76a3418b9838377b33e31889ff2fdb78bce1115a595
#. default-sha256: b1f6f3e0e758f4bc511cbcb4a8e95058304af7b3f5887bb705a79411ba051085
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_115FC035_3AAB_4941_9F70_A7FDD8BA7472"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫the female name she bestowed upon me at birth, which I so despised."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫il nome da donna che mi aveva dato alla nascita, e che tanto detestavo."

#: scenario7:scenario7_8E96DBA4_1306_4485_9EFA_369E279396E5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 399c4923b148f2068f80ab40ca0630f25f32ec7083f344f126087126436bbfeb
#. default-sha256: aca079ec2094663db8e27997f8f8fdc7c66f966d9ba295141b7390c3f001f3fe
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_8E96DBA4_1306_4485_9EFA_369E279396E5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Every time I used that name, I felt like I was denying my own identity."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ogni volta in cui usavo quel nome, mi sentivo come se stessi rinnegando la mia identità."

#: scenario7:scenario7_D20445E2_F2CC_476C_91B1_81FD0056EDE1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c6cd6525a3b058d93855d269665254f66847a397c6963b28a72dd2c6f64eb870
